; IBQConsole — Greek language file
; Translator: Alexandros Ntermaris
;
; Encoding: UTF-8. Use $nl for a line break inside a value.
; A key that is missing, empty, or commented out falls back to the English
; text compiled into the program — a partial translation is always safe.
; Keys are named <ComponentName>.caption / .hint, or module.purpose for
; runtime messages.
;
; Checked with:  utils/langcheck.pas lang/Greek.lng . --dynamic node.
; Every key the program asks for is present. When a key is added to the
; source, langcheck reports it here rather than letting it fall back to
; English unnoticed.

